        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, passenger car, electric, city car, without battery
The data set reflects the disposal of a light weight BEV. Aluminium and steel parts are fully recycled. Plastics are disposed. ;
UUID: dbc15a96-fce4-4659-92ff-51bff5f6e974
This data set includes the disposal of all remaining parts, that are not recycled. All recycled parts are attributed to the reuse process (cut-off)
Location: Data for disposal of vehicle parts in Europe.
Technology: Disposal to incineration or recycling (metals and batteries)
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literture 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_dbc15a96-fce4-4659-92ff-51bff5f6e974.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
